          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Freo Acquires Credit Marketplace IndiaLends to Serve Over 50 Million Users via Combined Platform",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Bengaluru-based digital banking platform Freo has acquired IndiaLends, a credit marketplace, in a move that will give the combined entity access to more than 50 million users. IndiaLends will continue to operate as a separate brand while leveraging Freo's digital banking infrastructure. The acquisition consolidates two platforms targeting overlapping segments of India's underserved credit market.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/startups/digital-banking-platform-freo-acquires-credit-marketplace-indialends/articleshow/130906454.cms",
